{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2022-07-19 07:55:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK® CANADA ANNOUNCES JULY CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES® ETFS', 'text': 'TORONTO, JULY 19, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BLACKROCK ASSET MANAGEMENT CANADA LIMITED (“BLACKROCK CANADA”), AN INDIRECT, WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE: BLK), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE JULY 2022 CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES ETFS LISTED ON THE TSX OR NEO WHICH PAY ON A MONTHLY BASIS. UNITHOLDERS OF RECORD OF A FUND ON JULY 26, 2022 WILL RECEIVE CASH DISTRIBUTIONS PAYABLE IN RESPECT OF THAT FUND ON JULY 29, 2022.'}